("table",["Multiple","Value ÷","Good for"],[["EV / EBITDA","Enterprise value ÷ EBITDA","Most companies; ignores debt differences"],["EV / Revenue","Enterprise value ÷ sales","Fast-growing companies with little or no profit"],["P / E","Share price ÷ earnings per share","Mature companies, banks"]]),
("p","Rule to remember: enterprise value goes with numbers that belong to everyone (revenue, EBITDA). Equity value goes with numbers that belong to shareholders (net income)."),
